(3487,'_transient_yolo-plugin-info-mihdan-index-now','O:8:\"stdClass\":35:{s:4:\"name\";s:80:\"CrawlWP SEO &#8211; Instant Search Engine Indexing &amp; SEO Performance Monitor\";s:4:\"slug\";s:16:\"mihdan-index-now\";s:7:\"version\";s:6:\"3.0.12\";s:6:\"author\";s:75:\"<a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/properfraction/\">properfraction</a>\";s:14:\"author_profile\";s:46:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/properfraction/\";s:12:\"contributors\";a:2:{s:11:\"collizo4sky\";a:3:{s:7:\"profile\";s:43:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/collizo4sky/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/59be5a085dd2cc872b243fec6eb78f887775972a7d0b63949dd99f8b0c945b4d?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:18:\"Collins Agbonghama\";}s:14:\"properfraction\";a:3:{s:7:\"profile\";s:46:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/properfraction/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/467020d4fbb95ba9c47a0ab9a74c122fae84b14baa2265d88c79c830dafc8804?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:14:\"properfraction\";}}s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"6.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:5:\"6.9.1\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.4\";s:16:\"requires_plugins\";a:0:{}s:6:\"rating\";i:96;s:7:\"ratings\";a:5:{i:5;i:50;i:4;i:1;i:3;i:3;i:2;i:0;i:1;i:1;}s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:55;s:11:\"support_url\";s:54:\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/mihdan-index-now/\";s:15:\"support_threads\";i:0;s:24:\"support_threads_resolved\";i:0;s:15:\"active_installs\";i:40000;s:10:\"downloaded\";i:636214;s:12:\"last_updated\";s:21:\"2026-02-10 5:44pm GMT\";s:5:\"added\";s:10:\"2021-10-30\";s:8:\"homepage\";s:20:\"https://crawlwp.com/\";s:8:\"sections\";a:6:{s:12:\"installation\";s:192:\"<h4>From your WordPress dashboard</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Visit &#8216;Plugins &gt; Add New&#8217;</li>\n<li>Search for &#8216;CrawlWP&#8217;</li>\n<li>Activate CrawlWP from your Plugins page.</li>\n</ol>\n\";s:3:\"faq\";s:2787:\"\n<dt id=\"how%20quickly%20will%20my%20content%20be%20indexed%3F\">\nHow quickly will my content be indexed?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>While CrawlWP submits your content instantly, the actual indexing time depends on each search engine. However, using CrawlWP significantly speeds up the discovery and indexing process.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"is%20using%20the%20google%20indexing%20api%20recommended%3F\">\nIs using the Google Indexing API recommended?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Google recommends explicitly using the Indexing API for job posting and live streaming websites; however, it can be utilized for any website.</p>\n<p>Please note that submitting content via IndexNow protocol or using the Bing and Yandex API in CrawlWP is entirely safe and recommended.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"i%20submitted%20a%20url%20but%20didn%27t%20see%20the%20url%20indexed.\">\nI submitted a URL but didn&#8217;t see the URL indexed.\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Waiting for your pages to get indexed can be anxious, but CrawlWP helps speed up this process. Based on our experience, pages usually get indexed within 24 hours of submission, often within a few hours. However, search engines (Google, Microsoft Bing, Yandex, etc) ultimately control the exact timing.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"why%20do%20i%20not%20see%20all%20the%20urls%20submitted%20indexed%20by%20search%20engines%3F\">\nWhy do I not see all the URLs submitted indexed by search engines?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Search engines can choose not to crawl and index URLs if they do not meet their selection criteria.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20submit%20the%20same%20url%20many%20times%20a%20day%3F\">\nCan I submit the same URL many times a day?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Avoid submitting the same URL many times a day.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20submit%20new%20redirects%3F\">\nCan I submit new redirects?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can submit URLs newly redirecting (for example, 301 redirect, 302 redirect, HTML with meta refresh tag, etc.) to notify search engines that the content has changed.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"i%20received%20an%20http%20429%20too%20many%20requests%20response%20from%20one%20search%20engine.%20what%20should%20i%20do%3F\">\nI received an HTTP 429 Too Many Requests response from one Search Engine. What should I do?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Such HTTP 429 Too Many Requests response status code indicates you are sending too many requests in a given time. Slow down or retry later.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"i%20have%20a%20sitemap.%20do%20i%20need%20crawlwp%20indexing%3F\">\nI have a sitemap. Do I need CrawlWP Indexing?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Sitemaps help webmasters inform search engines about their WordPress pages, but search engines don&#8217;t visit them often. With CrawlWP integration with IndexNow and the Indexing API of search engines, you can directly notify search engines of new content without waiting for them to crawl your sitemaps.</p>\n</p>\n\n\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:914:\"<h4>3.0.12</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added onclick field support to admin framework.</li>\n<li>Premium: Added <a href=\"https://crawlwp.com/article/seo-performance-email-reports/?ref=changelog\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">SEO Performance Email Report</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.0.11</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added WPML support for correctly getting translated post URL.</li>\n<li>Improved PHP 8.5 support.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.0.10</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added custom Cron health-check.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.0.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Set default log lifetime to 7days.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>3.0.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added effective 4XX error handling.</li>\n<li>Premium: Added <a href=\"https://crawlwp.com/article/overview-of-seo-stats-feature/?ref=changelog\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Bing support to SEO Stats</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://plugins.svn.wordpress.org/mihdan-index-now/trunk/changelog.txt\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">changelog file</a> for complete change log information.</p>\n\";s:11:\"description\";s:6905:\"<p>Improve your WordPress SEO with instant search-engine indexing, SEO insights, and indexing status tracking.</p>\n<h3>CRAWLWP SEO: WordPress SEO &amp; Indexing Tool</h3>\n<p><em>Boost and monitor your WordPress site&#8217;s visibility on Google, Bing, Yandex, Naver, Yep, and Seznam.cz with automatic indexing and SEO insights.</em></p>\n<p>CrawlWP is a WordPress SEO plugin for faster search engine indexing and comprehensive SEO insights, ensuring your WordPress content gets indexed instantly across major search engines (Google, Microsoft Bing, Yandex, Naver, Yep, Seznam.cz) and tracking your SEO performance in real-time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://crawlwp.com/?utm_source=wprepo&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_campaign=liteversion\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Website</a> | <a href=\"https://crawlwp.com/docs/?utm_source=wprepo&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_campaign=liteversion\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Documentation</a> | <a href=\"https://crawlwp.com/support/?utm_source=wprepo&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_campaign=liteversion\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support</a></p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"CrawlWP Overview - WordPress Instant Indexing &amp; SEO Insights Plugin\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dKjQTtQyRyA?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p>CrawlWP instantly notifies search engines whenever your website content is created, updated, or deleted, ensuring that search engines always have the latest updates about your WordPress site.</p>\n<h3>How CrawlWP SEO Indexing Works</h3>\n<p>CrawlWP integrates with IndexNow protocol to submit your WordPress posts and content to Microsoft Bing, Naver, Seznam.cz, Yandex, Yep.</p>\n<p>Because Google does not support the IndexNow protocol, CrawlWP integrates with Google Indexing API to directly submit WordPress posts for indexing.</p>\n<p>It also integrates with Bing URL Submission and Yandex APIs for submitting WordPress content for indexing. You might not need to configure and use the direct Bing and Yandex API integration for indexing since they both already support the IndexNow protocol.</p>\n<h4>🤖 What is IndexNow?</h4>\n<p>IndexNow is a protocol that allows website owners to promptly notify search engines about content changes, such as new, updated, or deleted URLs. It is a collaborative effort among several search engines (Bing, Naver, Seznam.cz, Yandex, Yep), enabling them to share received URLs with one another.</p>\n<h3>Core Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Instant Indexing</strong>: Automatically submit your WordPress content to Google, Bing, and Yandex for immediate indexing after publication.</li>\n<li><strong>Indexing on Content Change</strong>: Request indexing from Google, Bing, Yandex, and other search engines when contents (post, page, custom post types) are updated in WordPress.</li>\n<li><strong>Multi-Search Engine Support</strong>: Compatible with Google Search Console, Bing Webmaster Tools, and Yandex Webmaster.</li>\n<li><strong>Automated Submissions</strong>: New WordPress content is automatically submitted for indexing.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Premium Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SEO Performance Tracking</strong>: Deep Google Search Console and Bing Wenmaster Tools integration for detailed insights about your site&#8217;s search visibility and performance. <a href=\"https://crawlwp.com/?utm_source=wprepo&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_campaign=liteversion#features\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Learn more</a></li>\n<li><strong>Keyword Tracking</strong>: Monitor the performance of the keywords for which your website ranks using precise data instead of estimates. <a href=\"https://crawlwp.com/?utm_source=wprepo&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_campaign=liteversion#features\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Learn more</a></li>\n<li><strong>Manual Submission:</strong> You can manually submit specific WordPress posts and pages for indexing. <a href=\"https://crawlwp.com/?utm_source=wprepo&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_campaign=liteversion#features\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Learn more</a></li>\n<li><strong>Real-time Indexing Status</strong>: Monitor when search engines discover and index your pages. <a href=\"https://crawlwp.com/?utm_source=wprepo&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_campaign=liteversion#features\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Learn more</a></li>\n<li><strong>Bulk Indexing</strong>: Submit multiple URLs for indexing at once. <a href=\"https://crawlwp.com/?utm_source=wprepo&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_campaign=liteversion#features\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Learn more</a></li>\n<li><strong>Indexing Status Reports</strong>: Track the success of your indexing submissions. <a href=\"https://crawlwp.com/?utm_source=wprepo&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_campaign=liteversion#features\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Learn more</a></li>\n<li><strong>Indexing History</strong>: View records of every indexing done, last submitted date, and progress over time to understand better how search engines recognize your site. <a href=\"https://crawlwp.com/?utm_source=wprepo&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_campaign=liteversion#features\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Learn more</a></li>\n<li><strong>Email Notifications</strong>: Get an email report of WordPress indexed pages and alert when new pages are indexed and deindexed (Coming Soon). <a href=\"https://crawlwp.com/?utm_source=wprepo&amp;utm_medium=link&amp;utm_campaign=liteversion#features\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Learn more</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Why Choose CrawlWP SEO ?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Save time by automating the indexing process.</li>\n<li>Improve search visibility with faster indexing.</li>\n<li>Track your SEO performance in one dashboard.</li>\n<li>Support all major search engines, including Google, Bing and Yandex.</li>\n<li>User-friendly interface for all experience levels.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Improve your SEO rankings by taking control of the crawling and indexing process so search engines know what to focus on.</p>\n<h4>💙 Love CrawlWP SEO ?</h4>\n<p>If the plugin was useful, rate it with a <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/mihdan-index-now/reviews/\" rel=\"ugc\">5-star rating</a> and write a few nice words.</p>\n<h4>What&#8217;s Next?</h4>\n<p>If you like this plugin, then consider checking out our other products.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://mailoptin.io/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">MailOptin</a> &#8211; Create popups and optin forms for capturing email newsletter subscribers. Integrates with MailerLite, Infusionsoft, ActiveCampaign, Campaign Monitor, Brevo, AWeber, Sendy &amp; more.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://profilepress.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">ProfilePress</a> &#8211; The best custom registration, login, front-end profile and user management plugin in the market.</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fusewp.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FuseWP</a> &#8211; Connect wordPress to marketing platforms and sync users to your email list.</li>\n</ul>\n\";s:11:\"screenshots\";s:1751:\"<ol><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=3190776\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=3190776\" alt=\"Settings.\"></a><p>Settings.</p></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=3190776\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=3190776\" alt=\"API Settings\"></a><p>API Settings</p></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-3.png?rev=3190776\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-3.png?rev=3190776\" alt=\"(Premium) Indexing History Chart.\"></a><p>(Premium) Indexing History Chart.</p></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-4.png?rev=3190776\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-4.png?rev=3190776\" alt=\"(Premium) Posts and their index status.\"></a><p>(Premium) Posts and their index status.</p></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-5.png?rev=3190776\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-5.png?rev=3190776\" alt=\"(Premium) Google Search Performance Chart\"></a><p>(Premium) Google Search Performance Chart</p></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-6.png?rev=3190776\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-6.png?rev=3190776\" alt=\"(Premium) SEO Insights: View keywords, top pages etc.\"></a><p>(Premium) SEO Insights: View keywords, top pages etc.</p></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-7.png?rev=3458302\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-7.png?rev=3458302\" alt=\"(Premium) SEO Email Report\"></a><p>(Premium) SEO Email Report</p></li></ol>\";s:7:\"reviews\";s:15630:\"<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Mostly features in paid</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/maitla/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/fddeda214c0022aa17d00d903f8e8a4f3806672bfea2b9aa6992949fc3a3cf64?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/fddeda214c0022aa17d00d903f8e8a4f3806672bfea2b9aa6992949fc3a3cf64?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/maitla/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">maitla</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">January 28, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most of the features are in paid version</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Helpful Plugin</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"3 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"3\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/okcirmht/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ffdab5813b6a3e7be652e238ead042a07d13bf9c3365aa1b7b41d86f54df6fb8?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ffdab5813b6a3e7be652e238ead042a07d13bf9c3365aa1b7b41d86f54df6fb8?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/okcirmht/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">okcirmht</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">October 28, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Helpful plugin.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">شكرا</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/ali010ali/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/fcb74ef4b8f889934339f7af3eeaad813b7099b8669cdcdd4ee2bcb25c6f48dd?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/fcb74ef4b8f889934339f7af3eeaad813b7099b8669cdcdd4ee2bcb25c6f48dd?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/ali010ali/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">ali010ali</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">September 22, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>شكرا لكم خدمة ممتازة</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Excellent Product &amp; Service</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/dmstreb123/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/10377f50a445a265e1c8dca55bfc2bf78def83012f62f2b094639b9246bc716c?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/10377f50a445a265e1c8dca55bfc2bf78def83012f62f2b094639b9246bc716c?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/dmstreb123/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">David Streb <small>(dmstreb123)</small></a> on <span class=\"review-date\">September 11, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I have been using the plugin for a while and eventually upgraded to the pro version. It does and excellent job pinging the search engines and telling them \"Hey - look here!\" with indexing shortly following. We also recently move the Cloudflare Image delivery and had to some serious coding and somehow broke it.  \"Collin\" was extremely helpful getting us back in shape and did a lot of the troubleshooting himself. Would definitely recommend! A must-have plugin for any serious WordPress user.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great Plugin and Support</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/joeler/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/03208e92b05879688ae00f043f2e790c7071cffb60c0860b7afa40e858acf7d7?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/03208e92b05879688ae00f043f2e790c7071cffb60c0860b7afa40e858acf7d7?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/joeler/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">joeler</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">August 28, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Really well thought and developed, had a small issue, but was promptly solved by customer support.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Useful plugin</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/abhijeet41/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2da3e002dc541fb17a4a6408ad961a9eaae67c667d4132a417ea564f058187d2?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2da3e002dc541fb17a4a6408ad961a9eaae67c667d4132a417ea564f058187d2?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/abhijeet41/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">AK <small>(abhijeet41)</small></a> on <span class=\"review-date\">July 25, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This plugin is a must-use for anyone want to take advantage of IndexNow. Support is also very good and prompt with paid subscription.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Support also on Weekends</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/mtwoffice/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ff2796711045b4a8a3e36f98a875c8284e136cecaaa2bc6b48e694e11a685ef9?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ff2796711045b4a8a3e36f98a875c8284e136cecaaa2bc6b48e694e11a685ef9?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/mtwoffice/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">MTWOFFICE</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">July 20, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great and fast support, also on weekends. Well done girls nd guys </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Effortless SEO Monitoring with Outstanding Support</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/pkrieg/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c267240fb56056366317b885cb6412e86763bd46751782ec157c534702ee16ac?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/c267240fb56056366317b885cb6412e86763bd46751782ec157c534702ee16ac?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/pkrieg/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">pkrieg</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">June 24, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I\'ve been using CrawlWP SEO for several months, and it\'s become an essential part of my SEO toolkit. The instant search engine indexing feature works exactly as advertised, and once you complete the initial setup, it\'s pretty much set and forget - the tool runs automatically in the background. The SEO performance monitoring dashboard gives clear, actionable insights without overwhelming complexity. What really impressed me most was their customer support - they responded within hours with detailed answers and remain incredibly responsive even after purchase. For anyone serious about improving their SEO performance and indexing speed, CrawlWP SEO delivers on its promises with minimal ongoing effort required.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Awesome Support</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/andrelung/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/58e11c2be1c89477799b1535faa3fe598104542fe9392172bc9f65605a06e5a1?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/58e11c2be1c89477799b1535faa3fe598104542fe9392172bc9f65605a06e5a1?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/andrelung/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">AndreLung</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">April 9, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The plugin on its own is really good. Also the support was super helpful. Thank you very much!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Indexing the relatively easy way.</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/adriel1836/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6502e59a10dc74bc51d9d470dec9eb1d89208224b85da98bc254ed8ae9c294bd?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6502e59a10dc74bc51d9d470dec9eb1d89208224b85da98bc254ed8ae9c294bd?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/adriel1836/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">adriel1836</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">April 1, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your support staff helped me understand the process of Google indexing.  Thank you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:107:\"Improve your WordPress SEO with instant search-engine indexing, SEO insights, and indexing status tracking.\";s:13:\"download_link\";s:66:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/mihdan-index-now.3.0.12.zip\";s:14:\"upgrade_notice\";a:0:{}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:7:{i:1;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:69:\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=3190776\";s:7:\"caption\";s:9:\"Settings.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:69:\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=3190776\";s:7:\"caption\";s:12:\"API Settings\";}i:3;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:69:\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-3.png?rev=3190776\";s:7:\"caption\";s:33:\"(Premium) Indexing History Chart.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:69:\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screenshot-4.png?rev=3190776\";s:7:\"caption\";s:39:\"(Premium) Posts and their index status.\";}i:5;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:69:\"https://ps.w.org/mihdan-index-now/assets/screens