[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_heading\"},{\"id\":\"3a5c3a6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text_editor\":\"<p>Nam tincidunt ex at ipsum vestibulum laoreet. Phasellus posuere euismod posuere. Donec id aliquam lorem, id lacinia lacus. Curabitur est nisl, volutpat nec erat sit amet, accumsan egestas quam. Praesent finibus est ac sem blandit ultrices. Phasellus vestibulum eros vel dolor sodales blandit.</p>\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"18\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_text_editor\"},{\"id\":\"8e24bc6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"ac_items\":[{\"ac_title\":\"$ 19 Million  John Doe v. Jane Doe Corporation\",\"ac_content\":\"<p>Aliquam bibendum tellus sit amet nibh pharetra dictum. Etiam vulputate non est vitae elementum. Phasellus non odio ac leo scelerisque varius non non lorem. Mauris tempor purus metus, vel luctus massa eleifend non.</p>\\n<a class=\\\"btn-more style-default \\\" href=\\\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/case-study/metamorphosis-of-coins\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"pxl-button-text\\\">READ MORE</span>\\n<i class=\\\"zmdi zmdi-long-arrow-right\\\"></i>\\n</a>\",\"_id\":\"eebbfeb\"},{\"ac_title\":\"$ 10 Million  Gil Chavez v. D.R. Horton San Diego \",\"ac_content\":\"<p>Aliquam bibendum tellus sit amet nibh pharetra dictum. Etiam vulputate non est vitae elementum. Phasellus non odio ac leo scelerisque varius non non lorem. Mauris tempor purus metus, vel luctus massa eleifend non.</p>\\n<a class=\\\"btn-more style-default \\\" href=\\\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/case-study/metamorphosis-of-coins\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"pxl-button-text\\\">READ MORE</span>\\n<i class=\\\"zmdi zmdi-long-arrow-right\\\"></i>\\n</a>\",\"_id\":\"b61bfa9\"},{\"ac_title\":\"Catastrophic ear injury (sentence $2,500,000)\",\"ac_content\":\"<p>Aliquam bibendum tellus sit amet nibh pharetra dictum. Etiam vulputate non est vitae elementum. Phasellus non odio ac leo scelerisque varius non non lorem. Mauris tempor purus metus, vel luctus massa eleifend non.</p>\\n<a class=\\\"btn-more style-default \\\" href=\\\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/case-study/metamorphosis-of-coins\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"pxl-button-text\\\">READ MORE</span>\\n<i class=\\\"zmdi zmdi-long-arrow-right\\\"></i>\\n</a>\",\"_id\":\"8a35706\"},{\"ac_title\":\"$ 70 Million  Martin Rodriguez v. Jason Peden\",\"ac_content\":\"<p>Aliquam bibendum tellus sit amet nibh pharetra dictum. Etiam vulputate non est vitae elementum. Phasellus non odio ac leo scelerisque varius non non lorem. Mauris tempor purus metus, vel luctus massa eleifend non.</p>\\n<a class=\\\"btn-more style-default \\\" href=\\\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/case-study/metamorphosis-of-coins\\\">\\n<span class=\\\"pxl-button-text\\\">READ MORE</span>\\n<i class=\\\"zmdi zmdi-long-arrow-right\\\"></i>\\n</a>\",\"_id\":\"9c52734\"}],\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"40\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_accordion\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"5aa8967\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"css_classes\":\"anchor-inner-item\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"30\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"_element_id\":\"anchor-inner-review\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e78868b\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4b85efe\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Clients Say about lawyers\",\"title_tag\":\"h3\",\"title_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"title_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"15\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"title_typography_font_family\":\"Nunito Sans\",\"title_typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"title_typography_text_transform\":\"uppercase\",\"title_typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0.9,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_heading\"},{\"id\":\"93e6384\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"tt_content\":\"\\\"Great experience overall having Matt Cadwell as my attorney. Matt understands his client, very insightful and is an expert in his field. Truly a professional and marvelous individual.\\\"\",\"tt_description\":\"Nick Alvarez, Risk Manager at Petco Animal Supplies, Inc.\",\"rating\":\"star5\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"25\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_testimonial_single\"},{\"id\":\"f679b17\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#DADADA\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"12\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"12\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"f389100\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"tt_content\":\"\\\" These guys rock. The Goosmann Law Firm team is a good return on your legal investment. The Firm has been a valuable source for strategic legal advice for both me and my business. I feel confident and assured as a CEO and business owner knowing that the Goosmann team is on my side. Jeana is an entrepreneur, trial attorney, and savvy risk-taker. When I have a question. \\\"\",\"tt_description\":\"Josh Nelson, CEO of Great Lakes Communication Corp\",\"rating\":\"star5\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_testimonial_single\"},{\"id\":\"212d1c3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#DADADA\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"12\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"12\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"b17cdb5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"tt_content\":\"\\\" Jeana is an outstanding “connector” of people and opportunities.  She introduced us to a business opportunity that has turned into a highly strategic component of our overall business.  Her high energy, creativity, and strategic focus has benefited our business immensely and we have been blessed to work with her! \\\"\",\"tt_description\":\"Neal Greenberg, Partner & Director of CFO Systems\",\"rating\":\"star5\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_testimonial_single\"},{\"id\":\"ee2b635\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#DADADA\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"12\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"12\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"c2d1bde\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"tt_content\":\"“ I consider Goosmann Law Firm more than a law firm. They are a trusted partner in my businesses. Jeana and her team have a unique ability to look at issues through the eyes of a CEO to deliver the best possible outcome. Jeana’s laser-like focus on our goals and objectives has helped fuel our continued growth. I wouldn’t want anyone else on my team. ”\",\"tt_description\":\"Alex Imming, Real Estate Agent\",\"rating\":\"star5\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"pxl_testimonial_single\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
