le recoveries.</p>	\n    <a href=\"#\">\n                VIEW ALL ATTORNEYS\n    </a>\n                Frequently asked questions\n        <h2>\n                Client Popular Question            \n                    </h2>\n                                Do you charge for a consultation?\n                    <p>We never charge for an initial consultation. At the free initial consultation, we will discuss the details of your potential case, the legal process and answer any questions you may have.</p>                \n                                What about out-of-pocket fees?\n                    <p>We never charge for an initial consultation. At the free initial consultation, we will discuss the details of your potential case, the legal process and answer any questions you may have.</p>                \n                                Who will work on my case?\n                    <p>We never charge for an initial consultation. At the free initial consultation, we will discuss the details of your potential case, the legal process and answer any questions you may have.</p>                \n                                Does it matter how long I wait to file a lawsuit?\n                    <p>We never charge for an initial consultation. At the free initial consultation, we will discuss the details of your potential case, the legal process and answer any questions you may have.</p>                \n                                How much can I expect to win?\n                    <p>We never charge for an initial consultation. At the free initial consultation, we will discuss the details of your potential case, the legal process and answer any questions you may have.</p>                \n    <a href=\"#\">\n                VIEW ALL FAQS\n    </a>\n                                            <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img width=\"376\" height=\"100\" src=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/brand_01.png\" alt=\"