(5042,1,'2022-06-23 10:21:32','2022-06-23 10:21:32','<style>/*! elementor - v3.6.5 - 27-04-2022 */\n.e-container.e-container--row .elementor-spacer-inner{width:var(--spacer-size)}.e-container.e-container--column .elementor-spacer-inner,.elementor-column .elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--spacer-size)}</style>		\n        <h2>\n                We are the world’s oldest global law firm, <br />\nBut we are constantly reinventing ourselves.            \n        </h2>\n        <p>Technological disruption, economic crises, political risk – the challenges facing the world’s biggest businesses have been the same throughout history. We know because we have been at their side for nearly three centuries, giving them the confidence to shape the futureHis dream of establishing a law firm became a reality when he was joined by Gustav Larson in 1943 and in the 1950s by Robert Fenlon and Thomas Vogt to found Felhaber, Larson, Fenlon and Vogt..</p>	\n                1950\n                            <h3>\n                BIRTH OF POWERLEGAL            </h3>\n                    <style>.elementor-5063 .elementor-element.elementor-element-66117bf:not(.elementor-motion-effects-element-type-background), .elementor-5063 .elementor-element.elementor-element-66117bf > .elementor-motion-effects-container > .elementor-motion-effects-layer{background-color:#1A243F;}.elementor-5063 .elementor-element.elementor-element-66117bf{transition:background 0.3s, border 0.3s, border-radius 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;padding:35px 40px 35px 40px;}.elementor-5063 .elementor-element.elementor-element-66117bf > .elementor-background-overlay{transition:background 0.3s, border-radius 0.3s, opacity 0.3s;}.elementor-5063 .elementor-element.elementor-element-facc2cd{width:40%;}.elementor-5063 .elementor-element.elementor-element-facc2cd > .elementor-element-populated{margin:0px 50px 0px 0px;--e-column-margin-right:50px;--e-column-margin-left:0px;}.elementor-5063 .elementor-element.elementor-element-6ab354d{text-align:left;}.elementor-5063 .elementor-element.elementor-element-66e89df{width:60%;}.elementor-bc-flex-widget .elementor-5063 .elementor-element.elementor-element-66e89df.elementor-column .elementor-widget-wrap{align-items:center;}.elementor-5063 .elementor-element.elementor-element-66e89df.elementor-column.elementor-element[data-element_type=\"column\"] > .elementor-widget-wrap.elementor-element-populated{align-content:center;align-items:center;}.elementor-5063 .elementor-element.elementor-element-94ca942 .pxl-heading-wrap .heading-title{color:#FFFFFF;font-size:30px;}.elementor-5063 .elementor-element.elementor-element-5b9171c .pxl-text-editor{color:#D9D9D9;}.elementor-5063 .elementor-element.elementor-element-5b9171c > .elementor-widget-container{margin:16px 0px 0px 0px;}</style>		\n							        <section data-id=\"cf92c9d\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n						        <section data-id=\"66117bf\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.6.5 - 27-04-2022 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"768\" height=\"572\" src=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/history_01.jpg\" alt=\"History\" srcset=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/history_01.jpg 768w, http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/history_01-752x560.jpg 752w, http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/history_01-600x447.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />															\n                17TH OCTOBER 1950\n        <h3>\n                Our Beginning            \n        </h3>\n        <p>In 1950, during his third term as Governor, Stassen voluntarily resigned his position to join the United States Navy and serve the country in World War II. During his tour of duty, Stassen served as Assistant Chief of Staff to the much-admired Admiral William (“Bull”) Halsey in the Pacific Theater,</p>	\n		</section>\n		</section>\n                    <style>.elementor-5075 .elementor-element.elementor-element-66117bf:not(.elementor-motion-effects-element-type-background), .elementor-5075 .elementor-element.elementor-element-66117bf > .elementor-motion-effects-container > .elementor-motion-effects-layer{background-color:#1A243F;}.elementor-5075 .elementor-element.elementor-element-66117bf{transition:background 0.3s, border 0.3s, border-radius 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;padding:30px 40px 30px 40px;}.elementor-5075 .elementor-element.elementor-element-66117bf > .elementor-background-overlay{transition:background 0.3s, border-radius 0.3s, opacity 0.3s;}.elementor-5075 .elementor-element.elementor-element-94ca942 .pxl-heading-wrap .heading-title{color:#FFFFFF;font-size:30px;}.elementor-5075 .elementor-element.elementor-element-5b9171c .pxl-text-editor{color:#D9D9D9;}.elementor-5075 .elementor-element.elementor-element-5b9171c > .elementor-widget-container{margin:16px 0px 0px 0px;}.elementor-5075 .elementor-element.elementor-element-c85453b > .elementor-widget-container{margin:20px 0px 0px 0px;}</style>		\n							        <section data-id=\"cf92c9d\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n						        <section data-id=\"66117bf\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n                23TH July 1953\n        <h3>\n                Our First 50 Customers            \n        </h3>\n        <p>In 1950, during his third term as Governor, Stassen voluntarily resigned his position to join the United States Navy and serve the country in World War II. During his tour of duty, &#8230;</p>	\n    <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n                READ MORE\n    </a>\n		</section>\n		</section>\n        