100\" src=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/brand_02.png\" alt=\"Client Image\" /></a>                                        \n                                    <h4></h4>\n                                            <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img width=\"462\" height=\"100\" src=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/brand_03.png\" alt=\"Client Image\" /></a>                                        \n                                    <h4></h4>\n                                            <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img width=\"486\" height=\"100\" src=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/brand_05.png\" alt=\"Client Image\" /></a>                                        \n                                    <h4></h4>\n                                            <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img width=\"468\" height=\"100\" src=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/brand_04.png\" alt=\"Client Image\" /></a>                                        \n                                    <h4></h4>\n                                            <a href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img width=\"352\" height=\"100\" src=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/brand_06.png\" alt=\"Client Image\" /></a>                                        \n                                    <h4></h4>\n                Frequently asked questions\n        <h2>\n                Client Popular Question            \n                    </h2>\n															<img src=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/area_left-ppye0y6yqwarngw6w3mpatby2oz704ufou00af10cg.jpg\" title=\"Power Legal\" alt=\"Power Legal\" />															\n        <p>Our Orange County personal injury lawyers have a long history of helping the injured. Since we opened our doors in 1986, we have negotiated and litigated to secure the best possible results for every client. Our hard work resulted in considerable recoveries.</p>	\n    <a href=\"#\">\n                VIEW ALL ATTORNEYS\n    </a>\n                Frequently asked questions\n        <h2>\n                Client Popular Question            \n                    </h2>\n                                Do you charge for a consultation?\n                    <p>We never charge for an initial consultation. At the free initial consultation, we will discuss the details of your potential case, the legal process and answer any questions you may have.</p>                \n                                What about out-of-pocket fees?\n                    <p>We never charge for an initial consultation. At the free initial consultation, we will discuss the details of your potential case, the legal process and answer any questions you may have.</p>                \n                                Who will work on my case?\n                    <p>We never charge for an initial consultation. At the free initial consultation, we will discuss the details of your potential case, the legal process and answer any questions you may have.</p>                \n                                Does it matter how long I wait to file a lawsuit?\n                    <p>We never charge for an initial consultation. At the free initial consultation, we will discuss the details of your potential case, the legal process and answer any questions you may have.</p>                \n                                How much can I expect to win?\n                    <p>We never charge for an initial consultation. At the free initial consultation, we will discuss the details of your potential case, the legal process and answer any questions you may have.</p>                \n    <a href=\"#\">\n                VIEW ALL FAQS\n    </a>\n        <h2>\n                Get A Free Consulting!            \n                    </h2>\n        <p>Are you struggling and need help from a lawyer? Contact us for a free consultation</p>	\n<p role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></p> <ul></ul>\n<form action=\"/theme_powerlegal/wp-admin/admin-ajax.php#wpcf7-f5504-o1\" method=\"post\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" data-status=\"init\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7\" value=\"5504\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_version\" value=\"5.6\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_locale\" value=\"en_US\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_unit_tag\" value=\"wpcf7-f5504-o1\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_container_post\" value=\"0\" />\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wpcf7_posted_data_hash\" value=\"\" />\n<input type=\"text\" name=\"ct_name\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Your Name*\" />\n<input type=\"email\" name=\"ct_email\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Your Email*\" />\n<input type=\"tel\" name=\"ct_phone\" value=\"\" size=\"40\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Your Phone*\" />\n<select name=\"area_type\" aria-invalid=\"false\"><option value=\"Practice Areas\">Practice Areas</option><option value=\"Real Estate Law\">Real Estate Law</option><option value=\"Domestic Violence\">Domestic Violence</option><option value=\"Juvenile Crimes\">Juvenile Crimes</option><option value=\"Insurance Law\">Insurance Law</option><option value=\"Health Care Law\">Health Care Law</option><option value=\"Car Accidents\">Car Accidents</option></select>\n<input type=\"text\" onfocus=\"(this.type=\'time\')\" onblur=\"(this.type=\'text\')\"  name=\"ct_time\" value=\"\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Select Time\">\n<input type=\"text\" onfocus=\"(this.type=\'date\')\" onblur=\"(this.type=\'text\')\"  name=\"ct_date\" value=\"\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Select Date\">\n<textarea name=\"ct_message\" cols=\"40\" rows=\"10\" aria-required=\"true\" aria-invalid=\"false\" placeholder=\"Message\"></textarea>\n          <button type=\"submit\">send appointment</button>\n<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"checkbox-agree[]\" value=\"Agree to our terms and conditions.\" />Agree to our terms and conditions.\n</form>            \n        <p>Our location</p>	\n        <a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/BaUMMmNisxtjaHMT8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">1870 Alpaca Way Irvine, <br>New York, 92614. US</a>	\n    <a href=\"https://goo.gl/maps/BaUMMmNisxtjaHMT8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n                GET DIRECTIONS\n    </a>\n        <p>quick contact</p>	\n        Phone: <a href=\"tel:+38(050)-606-00-79\">+38(050)-606-00-79</a>	\n        Email: <a href=\"mailto:Powerlegal@gmail.com\">Powerlegal@gmail.com</a>	\n        “ We will answer you within 24 hours via email, or you can call us directly, we are always ready to serve. Thank ”	\n																<a href=\"tel:06506030553\">\n							<img width=\"29\" height=\"29\" src=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/customer-service.png\" alt=\"\" />								</a>\n        <h2>\n            <a href=\"tel:06506030553 \">\n                0650-603-0553             </a>\n                    </h2>\n															<img width=\"639\" height=\"823\" src=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/balance_women.png\" alt=\"women\" srcset=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/balance_women.png 639w, http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/balance_women-435x560.png 435w, http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/balance_women-600x773.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 639px) 100vw, 639px\" />','About US V.1','','publish','closed','closed','','about-us-v-1','','','2022-07-01 09:55:55','2022-07-01 09:55:55','',0,'http://localhost/theme_powerlegal/?page_id=5916',0,'page','',0),
