(6459,1,'2022-07-04 10:01:08','2022-07-04 10:01:08','Introducing Layla Grace attorney\n        <h2>\n                I am a lawyer with more than 20 years of experience. I can help you when you have a legal problem            \n                    </h2>\n        <p>For the past 30 years, we’ve helped people suffering from serious personal injuries and families experiencing tragic wrongful deaths. For the next 30 years, we’ll continue to do the same.The fact of the matter is that we enjoy using our expertise and resources to help people who don’t have the specialized knowledge to help themselves or, who don’t have the financial resources to take on the big insurance companies.</p><p>Our culture nurtures and strives to achieve innovation, creativity, legal expertise and is client focused. Daily, we enhance our entrepreneurial environment to be flexible and supportive, allowing our lawyers</p>	\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.6.6 - 08-06-2022 */\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}</style>												<img width=\"152\" height=\"55\" src=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/about_sign.png\" alt=\"Signature\" />															\n															<img width=\"768\" height=\"498\" src=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/about_me_left.jpg\" alt=\"About Me\" srcset=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/about_me_left.jpg 768w, http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/about_me_left-600x389.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" />															\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.6.6 - 08-06-2022 */\n.e-container.e-container--row .elementor-spacer-inner{width:var(--spacer-size)}.e-container.e-container--column .elementor-spacer-inner,.elementor-column .elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(-