іра клієнтів. Ми отримали багато цінних нагород завдяки нашим успішним справам. Наш пріоритет — турбота про кожного клієнта\n                                        <a href=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/about-us-v-1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n                    ДІЗНАТИСЯ БІЛЬШЕ\n                </a>\n            <img width=\"768\" height=\"253\" src=\"https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/h1_fancy3.jpg\" alt=\"Fancy Box\" />        \n															<img width=\"761\" height=\"707\" src=\"https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/h1_men_bg.png\" alt=\"CEO BG\" srcset=\"https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/h1_men_bg.png 761w, https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/h1_men_bg-300x279.png 300w, https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/h1_men_bg-603x560.png 603w, https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/h1_men_bg-600x557.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 761px) 100vw, 761px\" />																										<img width=\"440\" height=\"707\" src=\"https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/company_ceo.png\" alt=\"CEO\" srcset=\"https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/company_ceo.png 440w, https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/company_ceo-187x300.png 187w, https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/company_ceo-349x560.png 349w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 440px) 100vw, 440px\" />																		\n                ABOUT powerlegal\n        <h2>\n                A Passion For Justice. The Experience For Win.            \n                    </h2>\n        <p>At Powerlegal Law Firm, we have designed a community of legal service providers (lawyers, paralegals, legal assistants, nurses and other business partners) who are passionate about providing exceptional legal services in a creative environment. </p><p>Our culture nurtures and strives to achieve innovation, creativity, legal expertise and is client focused. Daily, we enhance our entrepreneurial environment to be flexible and supportive, allowing our lawyers</p>	\n        <p>Call us 24/7. Let&#8217;s start fighting together.</p>	\n        <p><a href=\"tel:26506030553\">+2 650-603-0553</a>  Or  <a href=\"http://lawyermolochko.ddev.site:8080/book-appointment\">Book Appointment</a></p>	\n																	<img width=\"152\" height=\"55\" src=\"https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/about_sign.png\" alt=\"Signature\" srcset=\"https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/about_sign.png 152w, https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/about_sign-150x55.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 152px) 100vw, 152px\" />																		\n							Harry Oliver,						\n									<p>\n						CEO of Power Leagal Law Firm					</p>\n                WHAT WE ARE EXPERT AT\n        <h2>\n                Legal Practice Areas<br />\n                    </h2>\n        <p>If you are accused of committing a crime, you will need the very best criminal defense attorneys in Fresno. We are especially skilled in the following practice areas</p>	\n                        <h4><a href=\"https://localhost:8443/practice-area/real-estate-law/\">Real Estate Law</a></h4>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost/theme_powerlegal/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/area_icon_02.png\" alt=\"Area Icon\">\n                                Forgery, auto insurance fraud, check fraud, credit card fraud, health care fraud, identity theft pretium est.                            \n                                <a href=\"https://localhost:8443/practice-area/real-estate-law/\">\n                                    READ MORE\n                                </a>\n                        <h4><a href=\"https://localhost:8443/practice-area/domestic-violence/\">Domestic Violence</a></h4>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost/theme_powerlegal/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/area_icon_01.png\" alt=\"Area Icon\">\n                                Domestic battery, corporal injury to a spouse or cohabitant, criminal threats, child abuse. porta massa                            \n                                <a href=\"https://localhost:8443/practice-area/domestic-violence/\">\n                                    READ MORE\n                                </a>\n                        <h4><a href=\"https://localhost:8443/practice-area/juvenile-crimes/\">Juvenile Crimes</a></h4>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost/theme_powerlegal/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/area_icon_03.png\" alt=\"Area Icon\">\n                                Proceedings, wards of the court, sealing of juvenile records, rehabilitation cases where a minor is tried.                            \n                                <a href=\"https://localhost:8443/practice-area/juvenile-crimes/\">\n                                    READ MORE\n                                </a>\n                        <h4><a href=\"https://localhost:8443/practice-area/insurance-law/\">Insurance Law</a></h4>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost/theme_powerlegal/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/area_icon_04.png\" alt=\"\">\n                                Possession of substances, possession for sale, manufacturing, under the influence, diversion in semper.                            \n                                <a href=\"https://localhost:8443/practice-area/insurance-law/\">\n                                    READ MORE\n                                </a>\n                        <h4><a href=\"https://localhost:8443/practice-area/health-care-law/\">Health Care Law</a></h4>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost/theme_powerlegal/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/area_icon_05.png\" alt=\"Area Icon\">\n                                Health care law focuses on the legislative, executive, and judicial rules and regulations that govern                            \n                                <a href=\"https://localhost:8443/practice-area/health-care-law/\">\n                                    READ MORE\n                                </a>\n                        <h4><a href=\"https://localhost:8443/practice-area/car-accidents/\">Car Accidents</a></h4>\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost/theme_powerlegal/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/area_icon_06.png\" alt=\"Area Icon\">\n                                Car accidents can be terrifying experiences. Often, at least some of the people involved are injured                            \n                                <a href=\"https://localhost:8443/practice-area/car-accidents/\">\n                                    READ MORE\n                                </a>\n                                1\n                                    %\n        <h3>\n                Number Of Times Won<br />\n                    </h3>\n        <p>We always strive to win for our customers even in the most difficult cases</p>	\n                                1\n                                    %\n        <h3>\n                Happy Customer<br />\n                    </h3>\n        <p>Our customers put their trust in us and we did not let them down</p>	\n                hands-on experience\n        <h2>\n                Recent Case Studies            \n                    </h2>\n        <p>Our commitment and dedication to continually move forward enables us to improve our representation and provide you with a service you can’t find anywhere else.</p>	\n    <a href=\"https://localhost:8443/case-study-classic/\">\n                view all cases\n            </a>\n                                    <a href=\"https://localhost:8443/case-study/strange-accident-happened/\">\n                                        <img src=\"https://localhost:8443/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/law_13-768x650.jpg\" width=\"768\" height=\"650\" alt=\"Case Study\" title=\"Case Study\" />                                    </a>\n                                    <h3><a href=\"https:/